<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan 28-,91-day T-bill yields up, 182-day down.</title>
<headline>Moldovan 28-,91-day T-bill yields up, 182-day down.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills at auction rose to 29.32 percent on Tuesday, up from 26.60 percent at the previous auction on September 10, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The annualised yield on 91-day T-bills rose to 31.12 percent from 30.19 percent at the auction on September 10.</p>
<p>Yields on 182-day T-bills edged down to 38.20 percent from 38.48 percent at the previous auction on September 3.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day paper auction:</p>
<p>						Sept 17	 Sept 10</p>
<p>    Issue volume			  5.00 million lei  3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			 1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			4.10 million	4.44 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			   4.10 million	3.00 million</p>
<p>    Annualised yield		    29.32 pct     26.60 pct</p>
<p>    Price				   97.8 pct	98.0 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			 97.8-98.5 pct 97.7-98.5 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				Oct 17, 1996  Oct 10, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the 91-day paper auction:</p>
<p>						Sept 17	 Sept 10</p>
<p>    Issue volume			  10.00 million lei 7.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			 1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			5.80 million	10.09 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			   5.50 million	7.00 million</p>
<p>    Annualised yield		    31.12 pct     30.19 pct</p>
<p>    Price				   92.8 pct	93.0 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			 92.4-94.0 pct 92.2-94.5 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				Dec 19, 1996  Dec 12, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-day auction:</p>
<p>						Sept 17	 Sept 3</p>
<p>    Issue volume			  3.00 million lei  5.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			 1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			1.91 million	4.31 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			   1.90 million	4.30 million</p>
<p>    Annualised yield		    38.20 pct     38.48 pct</p>
<p>    Price				   84.0 pct	83.9 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			 83.0-86.0 pct 83.9-86.5 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				March 20,1997 March 6,1997</p>
